      en: ["The largest refinery in Colombia with over 50 processing units.", "In operation since 1922, marking the start of national production.", "Processes approximately 250.000 barrels of crude oil per day.", "Supplies around 60% of Colombia's total fuel demand.", "Strategically located on the banks of the Magdalena River.", "The hub of the petroleum industry in the Santander Department."],
