      en: ["The zone was inaugurated in 2009 as a permanent service free trade zone.", "It features LEED-certified buildings to meet high environmental standards.", "The FOSCAL hospital within the zone is among the most modern in Latin America.", "Businesses benefit from a reduced corporate income tax rate of 15%.", "The zone is optimized for IT services through modern fiber-optic networks.", "It is located in one of the regions with the highest quality of life in Colombia."],
      es: ["Primera zona franca en Colombia con enfoque en servicios de salud y tecnología.", "Ubicada en la próspera área metropolitana de Bucaramanga.", "Alberga el Hospital Internacional de Colombia (HIC).", "Principal centro de BPO y servicios basados en el conocimiento en el oriente de Colombia.", "Diseñada con un fuerte enfoque en la sostenibilidad ambiental y zonas verdes."],
      pt: ["Primeira zona franca na Colômbia com foco em serviços de saúde e tecnologia.", "Localizada na próspera área metropolitana de Bucaramanga.", "Abriga o Hospital Internacional da Colômbia (HIC).", "Principal centro de BPO e serviços baseados no conhecimento no leste da Colômbia.", "Concebida com um forte foco na sustentabilidade ambiental e áreas verdes."],
      fr: ["Première zone franche de Colombie axée sur les services de santé et de technologie.", "Située dans l'aire métropolitaine prospère de Bucaramanga.", "Abrite l'Hôpital International de Colombie (HIC).", "Principal pôle de BPO et de services basés sur la connaissance dans l'est de la Colombie.", "Conçue avec un accent particulier sur la durabilité environnementale et les espaces verts."],
