      en: ["Member of the Organización Ardila Lülle conglomerate", "One of the largest bottling facilities in Latin America", "Produces brands including Postobón, Hit, and Bretaña", "Operates highly automated Krones bottling lines", "Leader in Colombia for PET plastic recycling initiatives", "Certified under international food safety and quality standards"],
